# IDE (Android Studio / IntelliJ) files.
#
# Ignore everything under .idea/ — it is per-developer machine state (selected
# run target, connected devices, local SDK paths) and does not belong in the
# repository. The one exception is the shared code style, which is a
# project-wide decision worth version-controlling.
#
# Note the order: .idea/codeStyles must be re-included before its contents can
# be, because git cannot un-ignore a file inside an ignored directory.
.idea/*
!/.idea/codeStyles
/.idea/codeStyles/*
!/.idea/codeStyles/Project.xml
!/.idea/codeStyles/codeStyleConfig.xml
